  "worked_solution": "The average value of a continuous function $q(t)$ on a closed interval $[a,b]$ is given by\n\n$$\n{q}_{\\text{ave}}=\\frac{1}{b-a}{\\int }_{a}^{b}q(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}q(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ≈348.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{q}_{\\text{ave}}≈\\frac{348}{4-0}=87.\n$$",
